# Review owners for spark-on-k8s areas. Roles and how to become an area
# maintainer are described in GOVERNANCE.md.
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owners of every path a pull request changes.
# Owner approval is only required when branch protection enables "Require review
# from Code Owners"; without it, this file routes review requests.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so each line must list every owner of its paths
# and any one of them can approve. To add an area maintainer, append their GitHub
# handle to that area's lines in the same pull request that updates the roster in
# GOVERNANCE.md. Keep a maintainer on every line. Owners need write access.
#
# Today @hussein-awala is the only maintainer and owns every area.

# Default for anything not matched below, including packaging and dependencies.
